The images bundle the following components, each under its own
license: Ollama (MIT), vLLM (Apache-2.0), llmfit (MIT), whisper.cpp
(MIT), llama.cpp (MIT), oauth2-proxy (MIT), Caddy (Apache-2.0, installed from the
Ubuntu archive). Open WebUI is pulled at the user's request and is not
part of the images. NVIDIA drivers are installed from the Ubuntu
restricted component and are not redistributed by this project.
Language models are downloaded by the user under their respective
licenses and are not redistributed.

Source availability: the unmodified Ubuntu packages redistributed in
the images have their exact corresponding sources published in the
official Ubuntu archives (archive.ubuntu.com, packages.ubuntu.com).
The source for SibillaOS's own packages and build tooling is this
repository. Repackaged upstream binaries are redistributed as released
by their upstreams, pinned to the exact versions recorded in
packages/build-debs.sh, whose repositories carry the sources. If the
source for any shipped component cannot be located through these
channels, open an issue and it will be provided directly.
